///1HELLO
Help by Willem Aandewiel
HELLO - Installation-specific program

///2STATUS
HELLO.COM appears in your directory, but it is not a fixed standard
utility in the CP/M 2.2 command set. This particular version's
function has not yet been established.
The name alone does not prove that it displays a welcome message.

///2ORIGIN
Consult the documentation for your computer or emulator.
WELCOME.TXT may contain information about the installation:

  A>TYPE WELCOME.TXT

A program banner, source file or vendor manual can identify HELLO's
purpose and any supported parameters.

///2DETAILS
This page deliberately avoids unverified options or behavior.
It can be expanded once the installed version has been identified.
